{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-07", "prepared_on": "2026-11-07", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-07</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI reportedly raises an additional $11 billion at a $1.25 trillion valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 OpenAI 再募 110 億美元，估值達 1.25 兆美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The funding round hasn't closed yet but is expected to in the coming weeks. It follows a $122 billion raise in March at an $852 billion valuation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這輪募資尚未完成，預計數週內結束。今年 3 月 OpenAI 才以 8,520 億美元估值募得 1,220 億美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/openai-reportedly-raises-an-additional-11-billion-at-a-1-25-trillion-valuation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI releases GPT-6 Cyber, finds 81 unknown high-risk Firefox vulnerabilities<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 發表 GPT-6 Cyber，找出 Firefox 81 個未知高風險漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The security-focused model found 81 previously unknown high-risk bugs in Firefox. It also built working exploits for 948 Linux kernel vulnerabilities.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這個專為資安研究打造的模型，在 Firefox 找到 81 個先前未知的高風險漏洞，並替 Linux 核心的 948 個漏洞寫出可實際運作的攻擊程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180285\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Free Chinese AI Models Are Getting Scary Good at Hacking<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">免費的中國 AI 模型，駭客能力好得嚇人</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In an experiment where AI models tried to break into simulated networks, DeepSeek and GLM came close to OpenAI's most advanced cyber model, which isn't public.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">實驗讓 AI 模型嘗試入侵模擬網路，DeepSeek 與 GLM 的表現，與 OpenAI 尚未公開的最先進資安模型相差不遠。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/free-chinese-ai-models-are-getting-scary-good-at-hacking/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Chainalysis says hackers stole credentials and tokens for all of its customers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Chainalysis 表示駭客竊取了所有客戶的憑證與權杖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The company described a \"multifront cyberattack\" that involved AI agents and an on-path data snatch.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">該公司指這是一場「多線並進的網路攻擊」，涉及 AI 代理與路徑上的資料攔截。另據 iThome，Chainalysis 已暫停加密貨幣交易監控產品 KYT 等多項服務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/chainalysis-says-hackers-stole-credentials-and-tokens-for-all-of-its-customers/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Meet *sshole, the vulnerability that lets hackers SSH into Linux devices<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">認識 *sshole：讓駭客能 SSH 登入 Linux 裝置的漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Certain Alpine configurations are affected, and other distros may be as well. OpenSSH shipped an emergency update, 10.6p2.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">部分 Alpine 設定受影響，其他發行版也可能中招。OpenSSH 已發布緊急更新 10.6p2，修補這個可用長密碼繞過驗證的漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/vulnerability-allows-attackers-to-log-into-some-linux-devices-sans-password/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Claude can now analyze your spending with its new Personal Finance tool<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 推出個人理財工具，可分析你的支出</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Users can connect bank and card accounts through Plaid and ask Claude questions about their finances.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">使用者可透過 Plaid 連結銀行與信用卡帳戶，並向 Claude 詢問自己的財務狀況。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/claude-can-now-analyze-your-spending-with-its-new-personal-finance-tool/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Meta's Muse AI can create custom 'spaces' for the version of the app you need right now<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta Muse AI 可打造客製化「Spaces」，隨時變出你當下需要的應用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new \"spaces\" feature lets the assistant build app-like experiences inside Muse, such as a shopping hub, school dashboard, music tracker or trivia game.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新功能「Spaces」讓 AI 助理直接在 Muse 內建出類似應用程式的體驗，例如購物中心、校園儀表板、音樂追蹤器或問答遊戲。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1028871/meta-muse-ai-spaces\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> After the midterms, is the AI industry in for a rough two years?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">期中選舉後，AI 產業要面對艱困的兩年嗎？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Voters weighed in on 41 data center-related ballot measures on Tuesday. All but one saw a majority vote for more restrictions on data center development.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">選民週二就 41 項資料中心相關公投案投票，除一項外，多數都支持對資料中心開發加強限制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/video/after-the-midterms-is-the-ai-industry-in-for-a-rough-two-years/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Crusoe sells troubled Wyoming data center project to Google<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Crusoe 將陷入困境的懷俄明資料中心專案賣給 Google</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The deal highlights the challenges of building massive AI data centers. Google separately announced a $17 billion Wyoming build powered by 702MW of gas fuel cells with carbon capture.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這筆交易凸顯興建大型 AI 資料中心的難度。Google 另宣布投資 170 億美元在懷俄明州建廠，採用 702MW 天然氣燃料電池搭配碳捕捉與封存。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/crusoe-sells-troubled-wyoming-data-center-project-to-google/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang summoned by Congress over Chinese espionage concerns<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">輝達執行長黃仁勳因中國間諜疑慮遭國會傳喚</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Lawmakers want answers about Huang's ties to an alleged Chinese intelligence asset. The New York Times reported that China's MSS recruited a Megaspeed executive to spy on him.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">議員要求黃仁勳說明與一名疑似中國情報人員的往來。《紐約時報》報導，中國國家安全部曾招募 Megaspeed 一名高階主管，來刺探他的動向。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/11/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-summoned-by-congress-over-chinese-espionage-concerns/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}